---
import Icon from './Icon.astro'
import Jason from './Jason.astro'
---
<section id="contato" class="section contact">
  <div class="save-crystal" aria-hidden="true">◆</div>
  <p class="section-label">Save point</p>
  <h2>O próximo capítulo<br />pode começar aqui.</h2>
  <p class="contact-summary">Aberta a oportunidades full time e projetos freelance.<br />Tem um desafio que pede uma visão completa de produto?</p>
  <div class="action-row"><a class="button button--primary" href="mailto:jessica.marques.dev@gmail.com"><Icon name="mail" />Falar comigo</a><a class="button button--primary" href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/jessica-maria-marques/" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer"><Icon name="linkedin" />LinkedIn</a></div>
  <a class="contact-email" href="mailto:jessica.marques.dev@gmail.com">jessica.marques.dev@gmail.com</a>
  <Jason />
</section>
<style>
  .contact { text-align: center; padding-block: var(--space-9); }
  .contact .section-label { font-family: var(--font-pixel); font-size: 0.65rem; }
  .contact h2 { font-size: clamp(2.5rem, 4.5vw, 4.3rem); letter-spacing: -0.04em; }
  .contact-summary { color: var(--color-muted); margin-top: var(--space-5); }
  .contact .action-row { justify-content: center; margin-top: var(--space-6); }
  .contact .action-row > .button { width: 185px; max-width: 100%; }
  .contact-email { display: inline-block; margin-top: var(--space-5); color: var(--color-muted); font: 0.75rem/1.8 var(--font-mono); overflow-wrap: anywhere; }
  .save-crystal { color: var(--color-primary); font-size: 2.5rem; margin-bottom: var(--space-4); text-shadow: var(--shadow-primary); }
  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: no-preference) { .save-crystal { animation: float-crystal 4s ease-in-out infinite; } }
  @keyframes float-crystal { 50% { transform: translateY(-5px); } }
</style>
